{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel back to the Warring States period and experience the thrill of chariots charging across the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game blends rich historical settings with intense, action-packed gameplay, immersing you in the epic clash between infantry and war chariots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the child of a renowned Warring States general, you will choose to side with either Prince Li or Prince Jia, fighting alongside them and uncovering a complex and gripping storyline. Face a variety of infantry formations, from sword-wielding soldiers and skilled archers to the unyielding spear phalanx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With diverse formations, deep tactical gameplay, and dynamic battlefield changes, every battle is an unpredictable challenge filled with strategy and excitement!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2628470?t=1750822940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2628470?t=1750822940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628470/b767ca4cf512be71ac97daf8756b20015ecdf43d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750822940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628470/b767ca4cf512be71ac97daf8756b20015ecdf43d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750822940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel back to the Warring States period and experience the thrill of chariots charging across the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game blends rich historical settings with intense, action-packed gameplay, immersing you in the epic clash between infantry and war chariots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the child of a renowned Warring States general, you will choose to side with either Prince Li or Prince Jia, fighting alongside them and uncovering a complex and gripping storyline. Face a variety of infantry formations, from sword-wielding soldiers and skilled archers to the unyielding spear phalanx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With diverse formations, deep tactical gameplay, and dynamic battlefield changes, every battle is an unpredictable challenge filled with strategy and excitement!</p>","developers":["\u4e2a\u4eba\u5f00\u53d1"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628470/89978075de82d8f5b3772eae7e25ef445807678b/header.jpg?t=1750822940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125526,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125526/movie480.mp4?t=1744545066","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125526/movie_max.mp4?t=1744545066"},"name":"\u5609\u79bb\u4ee3\u6218","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125526/344f4a98109a4e4dcc8d6657bc648b719ec97731/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744545066","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125526/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744545066","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125526/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744545066"}}],"name":"\u5609\u79bb\u4ee3\u6218","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u4e2a\u4eba\u5f00\u53d1"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_g